    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/ca01ee3c1f6691317ca8c704fc9efebc.avif?t=1723243066\" /></div><br><br><strong>Grand Gate\u00ae</strong> is a <strong>Tower Defense RPG</strong> with deep combat mechanics set in the fantasy world of Cohr.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/6a5387ed37f9e9ebb72209eafe0a9a59.avif?t=1723243066\" /></div><br><br>During your journey in Grand Gate, you will have to choose who is going to compose your <strong>tower roster</strong>. With a total of <strong>25 unique towers</strong> split between <strong>legends</strong> and <strong>pawns</strong>, you're sure to find a strategy that suits your playstyle!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/3998ca5b352de89f5a11e4e8effbb73d.avif?t=1723243066\" /></div><br><br>The world of Cohr needs to be defended from all kinds of enemies. <strong>Explore</strong> the universe of Grand Gate by playing <strong>60+ carefully handcrafted maps</strong> with unique challenges and several types of combat strategies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/d3fc6202d3fbe78a772b041a13010833.avif?t=1723243066\" /></div><br><br>Embrace your <strong>purpose</strong>. <strong>Protect</strong> the people of Cohr from the coming dark.<br>Being a <strong>commander</strong> is not an easy task to do, you need to find your allies and prepare to fight against different enemies. <strong>Customize</strong> your towers, <strong>create</strong> various strategies, <strong>experience</strong> challenging gameplay and <strong>discover</strong> the secrets of Grand Gate.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/285224c650b11219c72d5efb6d1ecbdf.avif?t=1723243066\" /></div><br><br>In Grand Gate, combat is defined by a set of rules and elements denominated as the <strong>Combat Sandbox</strong>. <strong>Scorch</strong> your enemies, <strong>bleed</strong> them out, <strong>overcharge</strong> them with energy. Use the skills of your towers to change the tide of battle. Scout the environment for usable objects like exploding barrels, crystals, magical shrines and so much more. <br><br>But <strong>beware</strong>, your enemies will also take full advantage of all these opportunities.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/dcd5cec4738cd4991ad8cf159155558d.poster.avif?t=1723243066\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/dcd5cec4738cd4991ad8cf159155558d.webm?t=1723243066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/dcd5cec4738cd4991ad8cf159155558d.mp4?t=1723243066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/ca01ee3c1f6691317ca8c704fc9efebc.avif?t=1723243066\" /></div><br><br><strong>Grand Gate\u00ae</strong> is a <strong>Tower Defense RPG</strong> with deep combat mechanics set in the fantasy world of Cohr.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/6a5387ed37f9e9ebb72209eafe0a9a59.avif?t=1723243066\" /></div><br><br>During your journey in Grand Gate, you will have to choose who is going to compose your <strong>tower roster</strong>. With a total of <strong>25 unique towers</strong> split between <strong>legends</strong> and <strong>pawns</strong>, you're sure to find a strategy that suits your playstyle!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/3998ca5b352de89f5a11e4e8effbb73d.avif?t=1723243066\" /></div><br><br>The world of Cohr needs to be defended from all kinds of enemies. <strong>Explore</strong> the universe of Grand Gate by playing <strong>60+ carefully handcrafted maps</strong> with unique challenges and several types of combat strategies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/d3fc6202d3fbe78a772b041a13010833.avif?t=1723243066\" /></div><br><br>Embrace your <strong>purpose</strong>. <strong>Protect</strong> the people of Cohr from the coming dark.<br>Being a <strong>commander</strong> is not an easy task to do, you need to find your allies and prepare to fight against different enemies. <strong>Customize</strong> your towers, <strong>create</strong> various strategies, <strong>experience</strong> challenging gameplay and <strong>discover</strong> the secrets of Grand Gate.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/285224c650b11219c72d5efb6d1ecbdf.avif?t=1723243066\" /></div><br><br>In Grand Gate, combat is defined by a set of rules and elements denominated as the <strong>Combat Sandbox</strong>. <strong>Scorch</strong> your enemies, <strong>bleed</strong> them out, <strong>overcharge</strong> them with energy. Use the skills of your towers to change the tide of battle. Scout the environment for usable objects like exploding barrels, crystals, magical shrines and so much more. <br><br>But <strong>beware</strong>, your enemies will also take full advantage of all these opportunities.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/dcd5cec4738cd4991ad8cf159155558d.poster.avif?t=1723243066\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/dcd5cec4738cd4991ad8cf159155558d.webm?t=1723243066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066370/extras/dcd5cec4738cd4991ad8cf159155558d.mp4?t=1723243066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
